          i preuzmite “.tar.gz” za Community Edition.</li>
        <li>U terminalu pokrenite:
          <pre><code>cd ~/Downloads
tar -xzf ideaIC-*.tar.gz
sudo mv idea-IC-* /opt/idea-community
